OL,3,ARescuers struggling to reach disaster
OL,4,Azone after more than 160 killed in
OL,5,ANepal-Tibet flash floods
OL,6,
OL,7,FRescuers are struggling to reach the
OL,8,Fdisaster zone after more than 160
OL,9,Fpeople were killed in Nepal in a
OL,10,Fmassive flash flood and mudslide
OL,12,FHundreds of tourists are missing,
OL,13,Fincluding more than 100 from India, 54
OL,14,Ffrom the US, 34 from Australia, and 33
OL,15,Ffrom the UK, as well as more than 100
OL,16,Ffrom Nepal itself, according to
OL,17,Fofficials. The area is popular with
OL,18,Fpilgrims and trekkers
OL,20,FExperts warn that debris in a river
OL,21,Fnear the disaster zone could trigger a
OL,22,Fsecond flooding event
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
