OL,3,ARescuers struggling to reach disaster
OL,4,Azone after more than 160 killed in
OL,5,ANepal-Tibet flash floods
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US, China, the EU and India are
OL,8,Famong the countries that have pledged
OL,9,Fassistance or dispatched relief
OL,10,Fsupplies
OL,12,FDozens of Nepalese police officers and
OL,13,Farmy personnel are also missing, as
OL,14,Fwell as power workers. My family was
OL,15,Fswept away in front of me, one woman
OL,16,Ftells us - she and her son survived by
OL,17,Fclimbing to a rooftop
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
