OL,3,ARescuers struggling to reach disaster
OL,4,Azone after more than 160 killed in
OL,5,ANepal-Tibet flash floods
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuthorities initially thought an
OL,8,Fearthquake may have preceded the
OL,9,Fflooding - but the US Geological Survey
OL,10,Fnow says the "seismic energy was
OL,11,Finstead generated by a landslide"
